# Marketing content (YAML)

Page copy lives in `src/content/*.yml` (nested `{ it, en }`). Page titles live on that page file (`title`; photo credits is `photoCredits.title` in `imperdibili.yml`). Header, footer, CTAs, and SEO read those titles. Pagine `chrome` is `site.yml` (identity and UI chrome, last in that collection, flat like Case `chrome`). Case `chrome` is `accommodation.yml` (flat house labels, last in that collection). Page-only labels live on that page file. Inbox is `inbox` in `contact.yml` (scalar). Occupancy, Lodgify ids, courtyard coords, and map hrefs are not these files.

## Must preserve

- House files `casa-1`…`casa-4` only; slugs and `capacity` stay in YAML (CMS hides them). Sequence is the import list in `content.ts`. House `paragraphs` and home `giardino.paragraphs` are `{ it, en }`; a blank line starts a new `<p>`. House `highlights` is a list of `{ it, en }` (one add/remove for both languages).
- Place sequence is the import list in `content.ts` (not filename sort).
- Amenities live in `amenities.yml` (eyebrow, title, items); awards in `awards.yml` (same shape). Home photos sit on their sections: `portone.wide` / `portone.tall` / `portone.alt`, `cortile.image` / `cortile.alt`, `giardino.image` / `giardino.alt`, `giardino.agrumeto` / `giardino.agrumetoAlt`. Home video alt is `video.alt`; play / replay / unsupported live on Pagine `chrome` (`site.yml` `videoPlay` / `videoReplay` / `videoUnsupported`).
- Write path is `/admin/` (or the YAML files). Do not invent a parallel copy store (CSV, second JSON, per-locale files).
